[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4619251431","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4619251431","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4619251431,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE1Qu5w","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-04T05:24:19Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T05:24:19Z","body":"Thanks for the review! I'll work on addressing the remaining comments/suggestions in the coming days.\r\n\r\nTonight I got simple underlining for errors working:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"397\" height=\"82\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-03 at 22 21 14@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/348ce1b7-ffbc-4628-b5ba-bdd6d6848068\" />\r\n\r\nI'm hoping to make the underline for errors a bit thicker than the one for warnings, and later on see if I can get all of the underlines to use a squiggle/zigzag instead of just a flat line.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4619251431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4643356611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4643356611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4643356611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFMP_ww","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-07T17:09:08Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T17:09:08Z","body":"Updating the underline positions when inserting or removing text appears to be mostly working now:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0221c83-e6ff-415f-8a81-473cbc042d74\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71445fda-1548-4973-92f4-4a3a2963e91c\r\n\r\nIts code can be found in the `TextEdit::_offset_underlines_after` method, which is largely following the same logic as `_offset_carets_after`.\r\n\r\nI noticed that in the first video, when typing *before* the unknown variable `this_does_not_exist`, the newly typed text doesn't get underlined until it re-parses (expected behavior); however, typing *after* the variable results in the newly typed text instantly being underlined. I suppose this still ends up being valid? But if I can figure out how to resolve that later, that might be nice for consistency's sake.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4643356611/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4643441682","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4643441682","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4643441682,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFMVMEg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-07T17:44:50Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T17:44:50Z","body":"We've now got squiggles for underlines!\r\n\r\n<img width=\"375\" height=\"117\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-07 at 10 44 06@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f7fbc73-918d-427b-8720-782805aed34f\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"395\" height=\"88\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-07 at 10 43 54@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b245f16d-e1ff-43ab-a905-15381bc6b6ea\" />\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4643441682/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4713041534","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4713041534","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4713041534,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGOtOfg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-15T22:38:19Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T22:38:19Z","body":"Thanks for the review, again! 😄 The suggestions have been incorporated.\r\n\r\nSwapping lines:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68c474fd-24a2-4d02-8343-bf6d167ec787\r\n\r\nI seem to have found a resolution for the issue where typing at the end of an underline caused it to extend the underline out:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b4df8fdb-cfee-4c3a-a4ba-55106e3a68bb\r\n\r\nIn this case, it came down to adding a check when determining the new range end:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588/changes#diff-323d72e23541597448c437d70984589dce3d4086dcb9e5ec2c213114e0dbeea5R8607\r\n\r\nI only modify the range end if the edit happened before the current range end (or, at least that is my intent). There have been a couple of cases where typing after the underline, then undoing and immediately typing again causes it to \"grab\" the range end, making the underline follow it. In the coming days I can look more into fixing it, but given that the GDScript file is properly re-evaluated (and the underlines corrected) just about as soon as the user stops typing, I don't know if it's super important that the momentary underlining status always line up perfectly. I don't recall for certain how other languages' underlines look in VS Code as you type, but I do recall that the underlines can be unreliable _while_ you're typing, but soon after you stop and the language server can re-evaluate the code, everything looks good again.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4713041534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4756679369","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4756679369","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4756679369,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG4UqyQ","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-20T06:07:37Z","updated_at":"2026-06-20T06:07:37Z","body":"Thanks again for the review! I've been able to address some of the comments tonight, but will hopefully get to more of them tomorrow 😄 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4756679369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4775997708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4775997708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4775997708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHKvxDA","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T05:37:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T05:50:59Z","body":"Progress continues to be made on the PR! As noted in the code review comments, I wrote (what I think is) a better algorithm for swapping lines' underlines.\r\n\r\nThis evening I stumbled upon a weird bug which I'll have to look into more in the coming days. The order of the warning and error squiggles is apparently no longer consistent, because depending on how the code window is scrolled, sometimes the error squiggle disappears (aka is covered by warning squiggles) and other times, it actually seems to switch between being on top and on bottom during each draw event...?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e0dbc67e-8b75-418d-a33c-46b5fae8d1b6\r\n\r\nThe quickest approach (and maybe actually the most sensical) would probably be to assign each underline a priority value, then sort them by that value before drawing them. So an error squiggle would always be drawn on top of a warning squiggle, for example.\r\n\r\nEdit: Just did a little more `print_line` testing and it seems like the underlines are still processed from the vector in the correct order, even when the error underline is visibly gone (or has a warning underline drawn on top of it). This is making me wonder if it's some kind of RenderingServer bug, perhaps...?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4775997708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4781992360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4781992360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4781992360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHQdpqA","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T17:54:33Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T17:54:33Z","body":"The flickering error line issue appears to be introduced with PR #116751. It does not occur when rebased on the prior commit, but does occur when rebased on the PR's commit or later. \r\n\r\nAs I was writing this comment and linking the PR, I saw it was marked as \"reverted\". So I updated my fork, rebased on the latest commit, and the issue is no longer occurring! 🥳","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4781992360/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4802784771","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4802784771","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4802784771,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHkSuAw","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-25T18:13:35Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T18:13:35Z","body":"Awesome, thanks so much for the approval and the thorough rounds of code review beforehand! I really appreciate you spending so much time on giving feedback and suggestions so it's polished enough for merging 😄 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4802784771/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4823356301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4823356301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4823356301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH36TjQ","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-28T00:32:58Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T00:32:58Z","body":"As per @HolonProduction 's request, I've removed the changes to ScriptLanguageExtension. As a result, error squiggles now cover the entire line an error is on. Warning squiggles can still cover only the relevant parts of a line:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"303\" height=\"182\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-27 at 17 29 19@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e7c1de0-fbe9-4218-b4f7-4e3df54759ff\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4823356301/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":2,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4824797608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4824797608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4824797608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH5SRqA","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-28T04:29:43Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T04:29:43Z","body":"I re-did the range variables for ScriptErrors so now we're back to error underlines only underlining the bad part of the line, while also keeping the ScriptLanguageExtension API intact 😄 \r\n\r\n<img width=\"405\" height=\"137\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-27 at 21 26 07@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1e4d1b1-d7a3-4df3-9798-299f5eff15ad\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4824797608/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4845382125","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4845382125","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4845382125,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIM6p7Q","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-30T15:46:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:46:23Z","body":"Thanks for the review, and for catching that! Turns out that specifically for the error end column, I forgot to include `- 1` in the calculation, despite doing it for the start column *and* both columns for warnings... 😅\r\n\r\nWith that fix, the error line ranges now appear to be good on my end!\r\n\r\n<img width=\"417\" height=\"156\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-30 at 08 43 30@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d01e5d41-5597-4582-9e0c-b730dbf61fba\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"911\" height=\"122\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-30 at 08 43 50@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18a78ebe-7764-4bf7-841b-51f7937bc03a\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4845382125/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4853119960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4853119960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4853119960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIUS72A","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-01T10:02:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T10:02:17Z","body":"Although, maybe a last question. Compared to your screenshots the line looks very thin on my device:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"234\" height=\"96\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f25a5777-43a8-4e2d-8ece-e5cdc43b81a1\" />\r\n\r\nWhat is this line size based on?\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4853119960/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4856808070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4856808070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4856808070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIX0Chg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-01T15:15:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T15:31:29Z","body":"Thanks for the review and approval!\r\n\r\nThe line thickness calculation for the underline squiggles is:\r\n```cpp\r\nMAX(theme_cache.font->get_underline_thickness(theme_cache.font_size) * theme_cache.base_scale, 1)\r\n```\r\nThis matches (as best I can tell) the thickness of the underline for matching braces/parentheses:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8dbf8a89910e4c8e5b73249884688653021a0074/scene/gui/text_edit.cpp#L1772-L1793\r\n\r\n~~I can try fiddling with my screen resolution and see if that changes the thickness of the line, since I do agree that looks a lot thinner than it should be.~~\r\n\r\nIndeed, it looks like the line thickness changes for me based on whether or not I have high resolution mode enabled:\r\n\r\nWith High Resolution disabled:\r\n<img width=\"1147\" height=\"492\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-01 at 08 23 31\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3552c30f-1dc7-4389-a7c7-4771e6a6630f\" />\r\n\r\nWith High Resolution enabled:\r\n<img width=\"1125\" height=\"420\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-01 at 08 24 08@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c8cd308-7b63-465f-87e2-dd93e5f8777c\" />\r\n\r\nHowever, as noted above, this behavior _is_ consistent with already-existing features of TextEdit such as the underlines for matching braces:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"334\" height=\"80\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-01 at 08 26 09\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37d9dcf3-685d-452e-b53e-4d7c03305259\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"335\" height=\"82\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-01 at 08 25 39@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a7c422a-f6b0-4360-a11d-8632763617dd\" />\r\n\r\nSo, it may be a bug/limitation in RenderingServer that needs to be addressed there.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4856808070/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4863131915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4863131915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4863131915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABId2BCw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T07:11:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T07:11:23Z","body":"Yeah, seems like it's worth looking into closer, but not in this PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4863131915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4868713932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-4868713932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":4868713932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIjKtzA","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T17:31:11Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T17:31:41Z","body":"Thanks for the review! I've removed the `* theme_cache.base_scale` bit, and added a comment to the line that provides (my understanding of) the explanation you gave: since the font size already incorporates the editor scale, it's unnecessary to use the editor scale *again* to change its size even more. I also provided a link back to this comment so that people can see the full explanation if they want 😄 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4868713932/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5061597740","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#issuecomment-5061597740","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119588","id":5061597740,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLbHaLA","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"ht